+| `RNDExploration.select_actions(q_values, agent_states, action_masks=None)` | RND191–211 forwards to legacy AS with **`agent_states.epsilons`**, not `self.epsilon` | Ambient action-sampler RNG only. No admission, predictor update, reward RMS update, epsilon decay or survival/history update appears in this body. |
+| `AdaptiveIntrinsicExploration.select_actions(q_values, agent_states, action_masks=None)` | AD85–101 delegates to `self.rnd.select_actions` unchanged | Same visible action path. No adaptive history/weight update appears here. |
+| `CountExploration` | Inherits `EpsilonGreedyExploration` (COUNT18,65); no local `select_actions` override anywhere in its complete 206 lines | Inherited selector is outside this source scope. Its exact method body, state-field reads, RNG and side effects are **unverified here**; inheritance alone does not establish them. |
+| `ICMExploration` | Inherits `EpsilonGreedyExploration` (ICM15,39); no local `select_actions` override anywhere in its complete 380 lines | Same inherited-selector limitation. Local ICM training/reward bodies are independently described below. |
